    "Related 360° panorama tools": "相关 360° 全景工具",
    "Slice a panorama into six PNG faces for a visible skybox. Check the engine setup guide before importing.": "将全景图分割为可见天空盒的六张 PNG。导入前请查看引擎设置指南。",
    "Turn a normal 2D photo into a full equirectangular panorama with AI outpaint.": "通过 AI 扩图将普通照片转换为等距柱状全景。",
